OL,3,GNEWSA'Dedicated' head teacher dies aged
OL,4,A42 from cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA head teacher who dedicated his career
OL,7,Fto children has left behind a "legacy
OL,8,Fof kindness" following his death, his
OL,9,Fcolleague said.
OL,11,FMatthew Curzon, of St Mary's Church of
OL,12,FEngland Foundation Primary School in
OL,13,FStansted Mountfitchet, Essex, passed
OL,14,Faway aged 42 on Saturday, from cancer.
OL,16,FCurzon, who lived in Bishop's
OL,17,FStortford, Hertfordshire, had worked at
OL,18,Fthe school for 15 years.
OL,20,FThe acting head teacher at the school,
OL,21,FKara Power, said Curzon was at the
OL,22,F"heart of our St Mary's family".
